      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds like a pretty massive regression in terms of efficiency though. if we switch to fixed-timers, we're basically losing all the real-time emergency vehicle prioritization and the way you optimize for sudden congestion spikes. do you see any major risks in moving to that kind of system?",
